{
  intro: '{left} Kwyjibo is a customizable system for quizzes, flashcards, to-do lists, and activity tracking.   Here are some example decks to try out:  - [Quiz on Grammatical Errors](/k/grammatical-errors)  - [Esperanto Vocabulary](/k/esperanto)  - [Korean Vocabulary](/k/korean)  - [Taekwondo Transcription](/k/tkd)  - [Daily Self-Care Checklist](/k/self-care)  - [Switch to Spanish Mode](/k/es)   Enter custom study items into the box below, separated by blank lines. Or [help fund the project](https://ko-fi.com/cliff "Donate on Ko-fi") by making a small donation, and I’ll add your custom data into the system to make it even easier for you.'
}
